"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1534225fcee>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**Vista Canais** -- o vocabulário completo de controlos (label, toggle, "
"slider, spin box, radio, line edit, select, push button, text), gráficos de "
